# A plain vert air (no trick) and a revert on the landing: the revert starts the combo, "Revert" (100).
# Before, a revert needed a trick already in the combo, so a plain air could not be reverted.
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
tap revert 360
run 600
expect event land{fakie=true} within 354..358
expect event revert within 358..362
expect event comboLanded{name=Revert,points=100,multiplier=1} within 368..394
expect no event bail
